{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 9, "model_name": "mistralai/mistral-small-4-119b-2603", "content": "**A Most Wondrous Itinerary for a Journey to Nippon’s Fair Shores**\n\n**Act the First: Arrival in the Land of the Rising Sun**\nUpon thy sojourn to Japan’s storied isles thou shalt first alight in the bustling metropolis of Tokyo. There do thou spend seven nights in the embrace of this modern marvel where ancient temples whisper to neon-lit streets. From the sacred grounds of the Meiji Shrine to the electric hum of Shibuoka’s markets do thou wander. On the third day take the swift Shinkansen to the imperial seat of Kyoto where tradition doth reign supreme.\n\n**Act the Second: The Imperial Jewel of Kyoto**\nIn Kyoto’s hallowed halls thou shalt dwell for five nights and bear witness to its timeless grace. Let the Fushimi Inari’s vermilion gates guide thee through the forest of a thousand torii. Visit the Kinkaku-ji where the Golden Pavilion gleams like a jewel upon the lake. Do not forget to sup upon a kaiseki feast of many courses ere thou departest for the ancient capital of Nara.\n\n**Act the Third: The Sacred Path to Nara**\nOn the morrow take thy leave of Kyoto’s embrace and journey to Nara’s tranquil glades. There spend two nights amidst the gentle deer who bow as though subjects of a king. Stand in awe before the colossal Daibutsu whose gaze doth pierce the heavens. Wander the wooded paths of the Kasuga-taisha where lanterns hang like stars upon the earth.\n\n**Act the Fourth: The Imperial Splendor of Osaka**\nFrom Nara’s sacred groves take thy swift path to Osaka’s vibrant heart. There spend three nights amidst the city’s mirth and merriment. Scale the heights of Osaka Castle whose walls have seen the rise and fall of shoguns. Feast upon takoyaki and okonomiyaki in Dotonbori’s lantern-lit streets ere thou dost depart for the isle of Miyajima’s wonders.\n\n**Act the Fifth: The Isle of Miyajima’s Sacred Wonders**\nUpon the seventh day of thy pilgrimage board the ferry to Miyajima’s hallowed shores. There spend a single night beneath the shadow of the floating torii of Itsukushima. Let the tide’s embrace reveal the shrine as though it walketh upon the waves. On the morrow return to Osaka to catch thy flight home or extend thy journey to Hakone’s hot springs.\n\n**Act the Sixth: The Farewell to Nippon**\nIf fate doth so decree thou mayest linger a few nights more in Hakone’s steaming embrace. There bathe in the onsen’s healing waters and gaze upon Mount Fuji’s snow-capped crown. When the hour of departure arrives bid adieu to this land of wonders and carry its memory in thy heart until thy next adventure doth call.\n\nThus endeth thy journey through Japan’s fair domains. May thy travels be blessed with fortune and thy heart ever light.", "logprobs": [{"token": "**", "logprob": -1.52700936794281}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0.0771452859044075}, {"token": " Most", "logprob": -0.30535033345222473}, {"token": " W", "logprob": -0.17044174671173096}, {"token": "ond", "logprob": -7.629365427419543e-06}, {"token": "rous", "logprob": -3.814689989667386e-06}, {"token": " It", "logprob": -0.3056759238243103}, {"token": "iner", "logprob": -0.001755483914166689}, {"token": "ary", "logprob": -0.005055264104157686}, {"token": " for", "logprob": -0.037327010184526443}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.257916659116745}, {"token": " Journey", "logprob": -0.540046215057373}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.06758516281843185}, {"token": " Nippon", "logprob": -2.885392665863037}, {"token": "’s", "logprob": -0.037000805139541626}, {"token": " Fair", "logprob": -0.03205176815390587}, {"token": " Sh", "logprob": -1.0029571056365967}, {"token": "ores", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "**\n\n", "logprob": -0.037745751440525055}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -0.16529323160648346}, {"token": "Act", "logprob": -0.13337579369544983}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.8283284902572632}, {"token": " First", "logprob": -7.748573807475623e-06}, {